    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "The C parameter tells the SVM optimization how\n",
        "much you want to avoid misclassifying each training example.\n",
        "For large values of C, the optimization will choose a smaller-margin\n",
        "hyperplane if that hyperplane does a better\n",
        "job of getting all the training points classified correctly."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "kXDCurZqqGXF"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Default hyperparameter means C=1.0, kernel=rbf and gamma=auto among other parameters."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "VkwDkK0Diks_"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
